dency_USP7, a benchmark is about 0.028; for dependency_KRAS, dependency_EGFR, dependency_BRAF, and dependency_WRN, about 0.025-0.030; for dependency_SMARCA2 and dependency_NFE2L2, the effects are expected to be very large if real. A proposal will be considered scientifically meaningful only if the signed estimate and lower interval bound support the registered direction near or above these thresholds. All claims remain observational within the supplied dataset and are not interpreted as causal or generalizable.",
